## Model card

- **Name:** Hy3 Preview
- **Short description:** Tencent's April 2026 preview of the Hy3 Hunyuan MoE (295B/21B, 256K context), superseded by the full July 2026 release.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `tencent/hy3-preview` — see meta.json
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026 per vendor docs; knowledge cutoff 2026-03
- **IDs:** `tencent/hy3-preview`
- **Context window:** 256,000 (256K) / 32K out
- **Modalities:** Text, image in; text out
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-23):** Paid preview ~$1/$4 — note: TokenHub preview ~$0.18/$0.59 per 1M (no Zen Free ID)
- **Architecture:** Proprietary

