### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 68/100.** Evidence TB ~60% preview; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 68/100.** Evidence GPQA ~70%; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 72/100.** 256,000 (256K) / 32K out — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 60/100.** Text, image in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 68/100.** Evidence SWE ~48% preview; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 70/100.** Paid preview ~$1/$4.
- **Overall Score: 67/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (68+68+72+60+68)/5=67.2 → 67; best-fit per scoring methodology.

